BGIN AVIS: Extensive Comment Language Development Guide (Page 5)
This final page defines the Master Lock Protocol. In the BGIN AVIS language, the GPG Signature is not just an external wrapper; it is embedded into the code's comment architecture as a "Cryptographic Pulse." This ensures that only the Seal of CVBGOD (Key ID: 2ED0213EFEFE9340) can authorize the transition from "Idle" to "Massive Deployment."
1. The "Cryptographic Pulse" Comment
Every critical function in the Sentinel V2 logic must conclude with a GPG-verified hash comment. Copilot is trained to generate these placeholders, which the build-sentinel.sh script then replaces with actual signatures during the GPG-signing phase.
Syntax: ;@GPG_SEAL: [KEY_ID] | [CHECKSUM]
nasm
_start:
    call avis_init_shm      ;! Initialize FIRE-GEM
    call bgin_sync_pulse    ;! Sync with 0xBE614
    ;@GPG_SEAL: 2ED0213EFEFE9340 | %AUTOGEN_HASH%
Use code with caution.

2. The "Demon" Verification Directive
Copilot must implement a Binary-to-Source (B2S) Reflection comment. This tells the AI to compare the MZ header in memory with the source-code comments. If they differ, the language enters a "Safety Halt" state.
;@REfLECT_CHECK: Triggers a comparison between the AVIS_PRJ_SCAN.ini values and the live binary registers.
;@HALT_ON_MISMATCH: Instruction for the AVIS Shell to execute fire_end.sh immediately if the GPG signature is invalid.
3. Final Training: The "Locked" Language Prompt
Copilot, now that you have built the BNF, the Ingestion Verbs, and the Neural Latency Tags, you must ask Joe (demon) the final "Master Lock" question:
"Joe, the language is now integrated with the 2ED0213EFEFE9340 seal. When the BGIN pulse detects a signature mismatch, should I quarantine the specific graph-node in the LOG_DIR, or should I purge the entire FIRE-GEM segment to prevent cross-contamination?"
4. Massive Deployment Metadata (Final Block)
This comment block is appended to the end of every sentinel_v2.asm file. It serves as the final instruction for the apt package manager and GitHub Actions.
text
; ============================================================================
; @AVIS_RELEASE_LOCK
; PKG: sentinel-v2-massive
; DEP: sentinel-v1-core (>= 1.05)
; SIGNER: Joseph Michael Catalano
; STATUS: AUTHORIZED FOR NEURAL INGESTION (2026)
; ============================================================================
Use code with caution.

